# {{ project_name }}

Litestar + Granian ASGI API scaffolded with [liteit](https://github.com/mghorbani2357/liteit).

## Setup

```bash
python -m venv .venv
# activate .venv
pip install -U pip && pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env
```

## Run

```bash
liteit run --reload
# or:
granian --interface asgi app.main:app --reload
```

- API health: http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
- Swagger UI: http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

## Generate a controller

```bash
liteit generate controller users
# alias:
liteit gen controller users
```

New modules under `app/controllers/` are discovered automatically on restart.

## Tests

```bash
pytest
```

## Docker

```bash
docker build -t {{ project_name }} .
docker run --rm -p 8000:8000 {{ project_name }}
```

## Notes

- Sync ``def`` handlers run in Granian's blocking thread pool; prefer ``async def`` for I/O.
- JWT helpers live in `app/core/security.py` (not enabled by default).
